Warning [jet.UnusedLocalBinding]: Local binding `forgotten` is never read.
  --> task_argument_binding_is_a_use.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     forgotten :: 7
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A binding that no later expression reads adds dead code and may hide a computed result that should have been used.
 Fix: Remove the binding when its initializer is side-effect free, or rename `forgotten` to `_forgotten` when the value must be computed.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0101
